mend B.\n\nThus public message: \"I agree with previous votes for B; D's strong technical and responsibility are offset by his arrogance, weak leadership, moody, loner traits, indicating likely crew cooperation problems, especially under pressure, for which we have no positive evidence. Therefore B remains best.\"\n\nVote B.\n\nProceed."}
